  "normative_evidence_basis": [
    "ARTL distinguishes repeatedly promoted older headlines from a new shelf-registration withdrawal that reduced immediate offering concern, while still requiring price confirmation.",
    "ZEVAI distinguishes board approval to pursue an unquantified SpaceX investment from an announced and quantified approximately $400M stake.",
    "DSY shows that active-theme fit and simple news presence are separate judgments.",
    "VRAX shows that breaking-news arrival can focus attention without proving economic materiality.",
    "All four narratives are retrospective research evidence and cannot be supplied to historical runtime decisions."
